      "mergeID": "604bd5fc27c63d3d9958b3e4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Having scripts execute everything immediately can be a pain in certain situations (eg;  Wanting a trigger area to clear before resetting it, and Unity has an in-built function for doing just this.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add WaitForSeconds to Udon",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5e9977668a3a3737f5d8a2e6",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While you wait for this, you can do set a timeoutEnabled boolean and set a triggerTime Time.time + 5f (5 seconds), then check it in Update until Time.time > triggerTime, and finally set timeoutEnabled to false again",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
