      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One thing I'd like from an eventual feature like this is an easy way to do a timed sequence with arbitrary intervals, e.g. fire Custom Event A, then 0.2s later fire Event B, then 0.1s later Event C.\nI do this for now by incrementing an integer via FixedUpdate and checking for equality on certain values :-P works OK, but feels mildly hacky.",
      "viewerReactions": null
